<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Deleting several nodes</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp; Deleting several nodes
    </h1>
    <p>
       &nbsp;
    </p>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" style=
    " page-break-inside: auto; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto;" cellspacing="0"
    bordercolor="#000000" width="490">
      <col width="235">
      <col width="237"><THEAD>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Deleting several nodes</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">After selecting one or several
            elements (nodes and / or links), the user can delete them all.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </THEAD><TBODY>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user selects one or several items using any of the use cases that
            explained how to do it.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=
          " font-style: normal; margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;"
          align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.When the type of editing is the selection of objects, the user
            presses the DELETE key or uses the option to delete which is the main menu on the
            standard toolbar or popup menus.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.All links selected are deleted.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.All the links that go out or come in to some of the nodes selected
            are deleted.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.The nodes selected are deleted.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.The use case <i>Updating the menus when changing the selected
            element</i> is executed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">7.A new point to undo and redo the deletion of the items is
            created.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">8.The use case <i>Updating menus when modifying a network</i> is
            executed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="235">
          <p style=" font-style: normal; widows: 2; orphans: 2;" align="justify">
             <font size="3">9.The network is marked as modified (if it was not already), placing an
            asterisk at the title of the window in which is being editing.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="237">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </TBODY>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
